  "solution": "Logic : (1st number + 3rd number) ÷ 2 = 2nd number\n\nGiven : \n\n__\n \n• 15 - 14 - 13\n\n(**15 + 13**__) ÷ 2 = 14\n\n__**28 **____**÷ 2**__ = 14\n\n14 = 14 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n__\n \n• 17 - 21 - 25\n\n(17 + 25__) ÷ 2 = 21\n\n__42 ____÷ 2__ = 21\n\n21 = 21 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo, \n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 19 - 22 - 25\n\n(19 + 25__) ÷ 2 = 22\n\n__44 ____÷ 2__ = 22\n\n22 = 22 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 34 - 12 - 28\n\n(**34** + 28__) ÷ 2 = 12\n\n__62 ____÷ 2__ = 12\n\n31 ≠ 12 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 38 - 28 - 10\n\n(**38** + 10__) ÷ 2 = 28\n\n__48 ____÷ 2__ = 28\n\n24 ≠ 28 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 23 - 42 - 46\n\n(**23** + 46__) ÷ 2 = 42\n\n__42 ____÷ 2__ = 42\n\n21 ≠ 42 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
